{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4c06b2bfc120965b","name":"Metamorph","source":{"id":"source:reference-4c06b2bfc120965b","title":"Metamorph","revision":19710,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:28:09Z","sha256":"a2f569cc4af76a3dd9231f8c42aa8a90f96b7cf16e05f846be8391350fba0848","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19710","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Metamorph&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4c06b2bfc120965b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a talented shapeshifter, capable of changing your appearance and body mass.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shapeshift"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shapeshift"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," 13, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can change your mass when you use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shapeshift"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shapeshift"}," Species Trait, increasing or decreasing your size by one step. You can maintain this form for a number of rounds per day equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["If you reduce your size to Small, you gain a +1 size bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and a +5 size bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks, but your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Carrying Capacity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Carrying_Capacity"}," is three-quarters of what it was prior to your use of Metamorph."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["If you increase your size to Large, you take a -1 penalty to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and a -5 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks. However, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Carrying Capacity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Carrying_Capacity"}," doubles, you gain a +5 size bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," increases by 1 square."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
